{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23634","headline":"感悟妄缘题如上人壁 · 白居易","name":"感悟妄缘题如上人壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自从爲騃童，直至作衰翁。\n所好随年异，爲忙终日同。\n弄沙成佛塔，锵玉谒王宫。\n彼此皆儿戏，须臾即色空。\n有营非了义，无着是真宗。\n兼恐勤修道，犹应在妄中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}